      "created_at": "2020-06-28T22:33:32.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I finally had my first experience with online multiplayer yesterday -- and sadly, found it nearly unplayable.&nbsp; There was a ridiculous amount of lag, things getting out of sync, etc.&nbsp; Was something weird going on, or is it usually like that?</p>\n<p>I was playing on an iPad.&nbsp; My wife (same room) was playing on a Chromebook, and her brother (in another state) tried a couple of different devices (Google Play, I think).&nbsp; I was consistently ahead of the others by a lot, and my wife was usually behind her brother.</p>",
